  "title": "Delectable Marinated Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "This marinated chicken thighs recipe is easy to prep with a sweet and smoky marinade of molasses, garlic, paprika, soy and teriyaki sauce before grilling.",
  "authors": [
    "Wilemon"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:04:33-05:00",
